  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Details : </strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Staff Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</a>&nbsp;</span>has released the Exam Calendar 2026 for Forest Guard, Forest &amp; Wildlife Guard, Nakshanavish, Manchitrak, Stenographer, Junior Assistant and Various Recruitment Examination 2026. The Candidates who are going to be appear for these examination can download their exam date as well as download their admit card too.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Staff Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Date :</strong> 11 January 2026 to 27 September 2026</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Admit Card :</strong> Before Exam</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Exam Details</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Name : </strong>UPSSSC Various Posts Exam Calendar 2026</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Exam Conduct : </b>Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Staff Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Staff Selection Commission (UPSSSC) has announced the proposed dates for all the stages of various competitive examinations to be conducted during the year 2026. Releasing the UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026 recently, the Commission has released the dates for various stages (Preliminary Exam, Main Exam, Interview) of Forest Guard, Forest &amp; Wildlife Guard, Nakshanavish, Manchitrak, Stenographer, Junior Assistant and Various Examination. Candidates can download UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026 PDF from the direct link given below.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Instructions For Downloading The UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open the Download Exam Calendar link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After that, a new pdf will be opened in which list of UPSSSC Examination has given</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">with details..</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates need to check their Particular Exam Date for which they are aspiring for.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also download their UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026 from official site of the UPSSSC.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Exam Calendar</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in//ViewPdf.aspx?oYEmOWynQkSzyPE3pqkE/fxjG2EnU7bWLmOM17w09Iw=\" target=\