\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Important Question</strong></span></h3>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Q. What is the UPSSSC Exam Calendar?<br>\n</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Answer. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Staff Selection Commission (UPSSSC) Exam Calendar is a schedule that outlines the dates for various UPSSSC examinations conducted throughout the year.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Q. Which Examinations are Included in the Calendar?<br>\n</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Answer. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The calendar includes the schedules for several important exams, such as: Forest Guard, Forest &amp; Wildlife Guard, Nakshanavish, Manchitrak, Stenographer, Junior Assistant and Various Examination.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Q. Where Can I Find the Official UPSSSC Exam Calendar?<br>\n</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Answer.</span></strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">You can find the official UPSSSC Exam Calendar on the UPSSSC website. It provides details about exam notifications, application deadlines, and examination dates.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Q. What is UPSSSC Official Website?<br>\n</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Answer. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The Official Website of UPSSSC is https://upsssc.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
